","Seine","Seinen"],"promptBn":"আলীর বাড়ি","id":"a1-practice-35-q12"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Ich kaufe ___ Rock.","answers":["einen"],"options":["einen","eine","einem"],"promptBn":"Akkusativ: der Rock → einen","id":"a1-practice-35-q13"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Wir gehen in die ___. (বিদ্যালয়)","answers":["Schule"],"options":["Schule","Post","Bank"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে বেছে নিন","id":"a1-practice-35-q14"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Ich habe ___ Hunger.","answers":["keinen"],"options":["keinen","keine","keinem"],"promptBn":"der Hunger → keinen","id":"a1-practice-35-q15"}],"requires":{"grammar":23,"vocabulary":23}},"schema":1,"id":"a1-practice-35","level":"A1","test":[]}